// Title: Suspicious Path In Keyboard Layout IME File Registry Value
// Sigma ID: 9d8f9bb8-01af-4e15-a3a2-349071530530
// Status: test | Level: high
// Author: X__Junior (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-11-21 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: defense-impairment, T1685
// Description: Detects usage of Windows Input Method Editor (IME) keyboard layout feature, which allows an
//   attacker to load a DLL into the process after sending the WM_INPUTLANGCHANGEREQUEST message.
//   Before doing this, the client needs to register the DLL in a special registry key that is
//   assumed to implement this keyboard layout. This registry key should store a value named "Ime
//   File" with a DLL path. IMEs are essential for languages that have more characters than can be
//   represented on a standard keyboard, such as Chinese, Japanese, and Korean.
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/guntior-story-advanced-bootkit-doesnt-rely-windows-disk-baranov-wue8e/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/ccbb0369507f796db0b0ae6854c8a2be471b9d84/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_ime_suspicious_paths.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.
// Note: 1 wildcard comparison(s) rewritten to 'matches regex' (KQL treats * in contains/endswith/== as a literal character)

DeviceRegistryEvents
| where (RegistryKey matches regex @"(?i)\\Control\\Keyboard Layouts.*$" and RegistryKey contains "Ime File") and ((RegistryValueData contains ":\\Perflogs\\" or RegistryValueData contains ":\\Users\\Public\\" or RegistryValueData contains ":\\Windows\\Temp\\" or RegistryValueData contains "\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\" or RegistryValueData contains "\\AppData\\Roaming\\" or RegistryValueData contains "\\Temporary Internet") or ((RegistryValueData contains ":\\Users\\" and RegistryValueData contains "\\Favorites\\") or (RegistryValueData contains ":\\Users\\" and RegistryValueData contains "\\Favourites\\") or (RegistryValueData contains ":\\Users\\" and RegistryValueData contains "\\Contacts\\")))
